  "content": "\n\n<h1>Backpacked：色彩世界</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>由 MrCrayfish 開發的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a> 擴充模組</li>\n<li>為標準背包新增全部 16 種染色變體</li>\n<li>使用您選擇的染料製作背包，即可獲得對應顏色</li>\n<li>對於 <= v2.0.0 版本，所有顏色變體預設均已解鎖，無需進度要求</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>已知問題</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><= v2.0.0</strong><ul>\n<li>在背包介面內無法使用滑鼠滾輪捲動</li>\n<li><strong>解決方法：</strong>使用介面側邊的捲軸來瀏覽背包欄位</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbackpacked-world-of-color\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=1AD166\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uttj34u4PJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Server-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=5865f2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
